title: sandbox
new-page: true
tags: sandbox
is-card: true
card-image: img/EbertSandcastle.jpg
go-to: sandbox_menu

= Sandbox Menu

@sandbox_menu

- @disable_end: Disable End In 1932
- @enable_end: Enable End In 1932
- @clear_hand: Clear Cards
- @make_adv_available: Make Advisors Available
- @re_alive: Trigger or undo scripted deaths
- @president: Change the President
- @chancellor: Change the Chancellor
- @government: Change the Government Coalition
- @co-leaders: Change the SPD Co-leaders
- @editresources: Edit Resources
- @editbudget: Edit Budget
- @editeconomy: Edit Economy
- @editrelations: Edit Party Relations & Coalition Dissent
- @editpartysupport: Edit Party Support
- @editelectoral: Edit Electoral Threshold
- @editfactions: Edit SPD Factions
- @miscparty: Miscellaneous Party Options
- @editironfront: Edit Iron Front
- @editparamilitary: Edit Paramilitary Groups
- @editreichswehr: Edit Reichswehr and Police
- @root: Exit Sandbox Menu

@re_alive

Please choose which figure you would like to either unalive or re-alive?

- @ebert_unalive
- @ebert_re_alive
- @muller_unalive
- @muller_re_alive
- @levi_unalive
- @levi_re_alive
- @stresemann_unalive
- @stresemann_re_alive
- @hindenburg_unalive
- @hindenburg_re_alive
- @sandbox_menu: Go back

@ebert_unalive
title: Unalive Ebert
view-if: ebert_dead == 0
on-arrival: ebert_dead = 1
go-to: re_alive

Ebert is dead. But violence is always reactionary...

@ebert_re_alive
title: Re-alive Ebert
view-if: ebert_dead == 1
on-arrival: ebert_dead = 0
go-to: re_alive

Ebert is alive again. Yay?

@muller_unalive
title: Unalive Muller
view-if: muller_dead == 0
on-arrival: muller_dead = 1
go-to: re_alive

Muller is dead. Not much to say really...

@muller_re_alive
title: Re-alive Muller
view-if: muller_dead == 1
on-arrival: muller_dead = 0
go-to: re_alive

Muller is alive again. Spooky...

@levi_unalive
title: Unalive Levi
view-if: levi_dead == 0
on-arrival: levi_dead = 1
go-to: re_alive

Levi is dead. The first former Communist to fall out of a window in a genuine accident...

@levi_re_alive
title: Re-alive Levi
view-if: levi_dead == 1
on-arrival: levi_dead = 0
go-to: re_alive

Levi is alive again. Spooky... Hopefully he won't fall out of a window this time.

@stresemann_unalive
title: Unalive Stresemann
view-if: stresemann_dead == 0
on-arrival: stresemann_dead = 1
go-to: re_alive

Stresemann is dead.

@stresemann_re_alive
title: Re-alive Stresemann
view-if: stresemann_dead == 1
on-arrival: stresemann_dead = 0
go-to: re_alive

Stresemann is alive again. He can't be worse than Scholz and Dingeldy, right?

@hindenburg_unalive
title: Unalive Hindenburg
view-if: hindenburg_dead == 0
on-arrival: hindenburg_dead = 1
go-to: re_alive

Hindenburg is dead. But violence is always reactionary...

@hindenburg_re_alive
title: Re-alive Hindenburg
view-if: hindenburg_dead == 1
on-arrival: hindenburg_dead = 0
go-to: re_alive

WHAT DID YOU BRING HIM BACK FOR?

@disable_end
view-if: end_disabled != 1
on-arrival: end_disabled = 1
go-to: sandbox_menu

The end date has been disabled.

@enable_end
view-if: end_disabled = 1
on-arrival: end_disabled = 0
go-to: sandbox_menu

The end date has been enabled.

@clear_hand
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
if (Q.difficulty >= 0) {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main'] = [];
} else {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main.main_easy'] = [];
}
!}

Cleared all cards.

@make_adv_available
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 0;
!}

Made advisor actions available.

@editelectoral

- @electoral0: Set Electoral Threshold to 0% (Default)
- @electoral1: Set Electoral Threshold to 1%
- @electoral2: Set Electoral Threshold to 2.5%
- @electoral5: Set Electoral Threshold to 5%
- @electoral10: Set Electoral Threshold to 10%
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox

@electoral0
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.electoral_threshold = 0;
if (Q.constitutional_reform < 1) {
    Q.constitutional_reform = 1;
};
!}

Set electoral threshold to 0%.

@electoral1
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.electoral_threshold = 1;
if (Q.constitutional_reform < 1) {
    Q.constitutional_reform = 1;
};
!}

Set electoral threshold to 1%.

@electoral2
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.electoral_threshold = 2.5;
if (Q.constitutional_reform < 1) {
    Q.constitutional_reform = 1;
};
!}

Set electoral threshold to 2.5%.

@electoral5
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.electoral_threshold = 5;
if (Q.constitutional_reform < 1) {
    Q.constitutional_reform = 1;
};
!}

Set electoral threshold to 5%.

@electoral10
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.electoral_threshold = 10;
if (Q.constitutional_reform < 1) {
    Q.constitutional_reform = 1;
};
!}

Set electoral threshold to 10%.

